{"id":"n9aee2b45df","headline":"Fertilizer Supply Concerns Grow Ahead Of Spring Planting","summary":"Global fertilizer inventories and ongoing USMCA trade talks are adding uncertainty to the fertilizer market before spring planting. The input gives no further detail on prices or volumes.","why":"Fertilizer is a key input cost for crop producers, and supply shocks can feed through to grain and food prices. The USMCA links trade rules between the US, Canada and Mexico.","category":"commodities","event_type":"trade","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Washington","country":"United States of America","lat":38.9,"lon":-77.04,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"RFD-TV","url":"https://www.rfdtv.com/fertilizer-supply-concerns-grow-ahead-of-spring-planting"},"sources":[{"name":"RFD-TV","url":"https://www.rfdtv.com/fertilizer-supply-concerns-grow-ahead-of-spring-planting"}],"published_at":"2026-10-13T16:31:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"42b914daed115a4f","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-13T16:31:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-13T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"SA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/farm-tractor-8266093.jpg","alt":"farm tractor (illustration)","credit":"Wolfgang-1958","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/turnip-vegetables-harvest-8266093/"}}